#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:1
msgid "Binary Cache"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:3
msgid ""
"The binary cache format is an interface designed for exposing a store over "
"HTTP."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:5
msgid "A binary cache consists of:"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:7
msgid ""
"A [`nix-cache-info`](./nix-cache-info.md) file at the root with remote-side "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:8
msgid "For each [store object](../../store/store-object.md):"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:9
msgid ""
"A [`.narinfo`](./narinfo.md) file containing the object's [metadata](../../"
"store/store-object.md#metadata) and a (usually relative) URL to the "
"corresponding compressed NAR."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:10
msgid ""
"A possibly-compressed [Nix Archive](../../store/file-system-object/content-"
"address.md#serial-nix-archive) containing the store object's file system "
"data."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:11
msgid ""
"For every entry in the [build trace](../../store/build-trace.md), a JSON "
"file at `build-trace-v2/<drvBaseName>/<outputName>.doi`:"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:12
msgid ""
"the path encodes the [key](../../protocols/json/build-trace-entry.md#key)"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:13
msgid ""
"the contents are the [value](../../protocols/json/build-trace-entry."
"md#value)."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:15
msgid ""
"The following [store types](../../store/types/index.md) use the binary cache "
"format:"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:17
msgid ""
"[HTTP Binary Cache Store](../../store/types/http-binary-cache-store.md) — "
"served over HTTP(S)"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:18
msgid ""
"[Local Binary Cache Store](../../store/types/local-binary-cache-store.md) — "
"stored on the file system"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/index.md:19
msgid ""
"[S3 Binary Cache Store](../../store/types/s3-binary-cache-store.md) — stored "
"in an AWS S3 bucket"
msgstr ""
